Homepage: https://github.com/cybroidinstitute/cit-os
Description: CIT-OS identity and brand assets
 The CIT-OS identity (/etc/os-release), login banners (/etc/issue,
 /etc/motd) and the logo in SVG form under /usr/share/citos/branding.
 Shared by every CIT-OS target: Raspberry Pi, desktop, server and
 containers.
